        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dorothy Zbornak, Bea Arthur, Maude Findlay\n- Products: The Golden Girls\n- Concepts: fictional characters, acting roles\n\nFacts:\n- Bea Arthur was born as Bernice Frankel on May 13, 1922, and she was an American actress, comedian, singer, and animal rights activist.\n- Dorothy Zbornak, née Petrillo, is a fictional character from the television series The Golden Girls.\n- Bea Arthur portrayed Dorothy Zbornak for 7 years across 183 episodes of The Golden Girls.\n- Maude Findlay was portrayed by Emmy-winning actress Bea Arthur.\n- Bea Arthur died on April 25, 2009.",
